## Quick Start

{{ install }}

Import the ROM, then play or evaluate the immutable checkpoint:

```bash
uv run gradlab rom import ~/roms --game {{ game }}
uv run gradlab play {{ model_ref }}
uv run gradlab eval {{ model_ref }}
```

